    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d291">

                <pb facs="0748" n="662" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg662"/>

                <head>No. 288.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. <persName type="from"
                            >Nelson</persName> to Mr. <persName corresp="#p_HF1" type="to"
                            >Fish</persName>.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1873-04-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 5, 1873</date>. (Received April
                        23.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 723.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The national Congress was opened with the
                    usual ceremonies on the evening of the 1st instant, on which occasion President
                    Lerdo delivered a brief address, a copy and translation of which is inclosed, (A
                    and B.) Mr. Francisco Gomez Palacio, president of Congress, responded in behalf
                    of that body, (C and D.)</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName>THOMAS H. NELSON</persName>.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d291-a1.xml" xpointer="d291-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d291-a2.xml" xpointer="d291-a2"/>
            </div>
